=\"color: #C1882C; font-size: 10px; line-height: 2.2;\">◆</span><span>118+ Years Heritage</span></li>\n          <li style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 13px 1fr; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2A2118;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color: #C1882C; font-size: 10px; line-height: 2.2;\">◆</span><span>Individualised Programmes</span></li>\n          <li style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 13px 1fr; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; color: #2A2118;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"color: #C1882C; font-size: 10px; line-height: 2.2;\">◆</span><span>World Luxury Award Winner</span></li>\n        </ul>\n\n        <h2 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: Marcellus, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 26px; line-height: 1.3; color: #2A2118; text-align: center;\">Not sure which programme fits?</h2>\n        <p style=\"margin: 0 0 26px; font-size: 16.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: #514A3F; text-align: center;\">Share your goal in your own words — the patient care team or an Ayurvedic doctor will point you to the right programme.</p>\n\n        <div style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; justify-content: center;\">\n          <a href=\"https://ayurvedichealingvillage.com/online-consultation/\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 52px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 4px; background: #EEB41E; color: #2A2118; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 1.5px; text-transform: uppercase;\" style-hover=\"background: #E0A70F;\">Free Doctor Consultation</a>\n          <a href=\"https://wa.me/919289838797\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; height: 52px; padding: 0 16px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1.5px solid #006038; color: #006038; background: transparent; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; le